%% StoryLab Voice — ask the AI tutor a question (online path)
%% Render at https://mermaid.live or paste into the Canva sequence-diagram frame.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant UI as Browser UI (chatbot.js)
    participant SR as Web Speech (STT)
    participant TS as TutorSession
    participant API as Node proxy /api/tutor
    participant G as Groq inference API
    participant TTS as Web Speech (TTS)

    S->>UI: presses MIC (or TYPE)
    UI->>SR: start recognition (lang = profile language)
    SR-->>UI: interim transcript
    SR-->>UI: final transcript
    UI->>TS: ask(transcript)

    alt curated topic matched
        TS-->>UI: answer from local library (no network)
    else free-form question
        TS->>TS: append last 3 exchanges + current lesson step
        TS->>API: POST {question, language, history, context, stream:true}
        API->>API: same-origin check, 16 KB cap, rate limit, guardrail
        alt guardrail refuses
            API-->>TS: refusal in student's language
        else allowed
            API->>G: chat completion (stream)
            loop each token
                G-->>API: delta
                API-->>TS: SSE data: {"delta": "..."}
                TS-->>UI: append text to readout
            end
            API-->>TS: data: [DONE]
        end
    end

    TS-->>UI: final answer text
    UI->>TTS: speak(answer)
    TTS-->>S: audio
    TS->>TS: push exchange to history (max 6 messages)
